{"id":"en_inner-thoughts-outer-schemes","title":"Inner Thoughts & Outer Schemes","titleEn":"Inner Thoughts & Outer Schemes","description":"After being framed for plagiarism by her friend Sarah Moore and pushed from a rooftop, Natalie Jones unexpectedly gets a second chance at life. She learns that Sarah can eavesdrop on people's inner thoughts, so Natalie binds herself to a Thought Modification System to launch her counterattack. Combining the system's abilities with her own intelligence, she steadily reveals Sarah's true nature. By the end, Natalie earns a graduate admission offer, receives an invitation to the Victor family's banquet, and finds love as well.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/inner-thoughts-and-outer-schemes/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/inner-thoughts-and-outer-schemes/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Face-Slap","Out-of-the-Box","School","Teens","Underdog Rise","Urban"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci8aa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_inner-thoughts-outer-schemes_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci8aa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_inner-thoughts-outer-schemes_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci8aa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_inner-thoughts-outer-schemes_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci8aa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_inner-thoughts-outer-schemes_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumb